   "version": "4.5.1",
   "description": "<h1>This release is for SPT 4.1</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a new interop that More Bots API can take advantage of in SAIN</li>\n<li>Removed bots shooting center mass for a new weighting system that should allow for better configuration of where bots might shoot</li>\n<li>Fixed bots cycling weapons infinitely if they are not usable (I hope)</li>\n<li>Attempted to improve how bots engage sniper scavs or other enemies that are in tricky positions</li>\n<li>Partially merged tactical device fixes</li>\n<li>Moved bullet impact hearing dispersion to linear</li>\n</ul>\n",
